    "text": "In the circuit shown assume the diode to be ideal. When $V_i$ increases from $-2 \\mathrm{~V}$ to $6 \\mathrm{~V}$, the change in current is (in $\\mathrm{mA})$\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/BRTAX7F05BNX2CwmhPaBc38waP7UU-NpysSepexmcWg.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
